Unclaimed or unidentified.

503
00:41:40,581 --> 00:41:42,249
There are a lot more nationwide.

504
00:41:42,333 --> 00:41:44,960
No fingerprint match.
She could be a foreigner.

505
00:42:03,771 --> 00:42:05,773
AUTOPSY ROOM
RESTRICTED AREA

506
00:42:14,406 --> 00:42:15,449
Hello?

507
00:42:17,159 --> 00:42:18,077
Where?

508
00:42:20,704 --> 00:42:22,039
Who from Violent Crimes?

509
00:42:26,293 --> 00:42:29,421
Han-su from Criminal Investigations
said you're after Kim Yeong-geun.

510
00:42:29,505 --> 00:42:31,298
I'm busting my ass looking for him.

511
00:42:33,175 --> 00:42:34,760
But there's nothing.

512
00:42:34,843 --> 00:42:36,679
No fucking criminal record or anything.

513
00:42:37,263 --> 00:42:39,348
That's right.
Because he's never been caught.

514
00:42:40,474 --> 00:42:42,017
He was known for being ruthless,

515
00:42:42,101 --> 00:42:45,396
mixed up in illegal gambling,
loan sharking, and all that.

516
00:42:45,479 --> 00:42:48,274
He made bank off illegal gambling sites
a few years back.

517
00:42:48,774 --> 00:42:50,693
Thugs know how to sniff out money.

518
00:42:50,776 --> 00:42:53,654
But they call him Noja. You know, Laozi.

519
00:42:54,655 --> 00:42:56,740
Like Confucius and Mencius.

520
00:42:57,324 --> 00:42:59,034
- Noja?
- He hasn't been around lately.

521
00:42:59,118 --> 00:43:00,327
We're after him too.

522
00:43:01,120 --> 00:43:02,204
What did the tip say?

523
00:43:02,788 --> 00:43:07,459
Something about him and the woman
found dead in the Hangang River.

524
00:43:07,543 --> 00:43:10,879
But I can't investigate without a lead.

525
00:43:10,963 --> 00:43:12,089
A woman?

526
00:43:12,840 --> 00:43:15,426
As far as I know,
he only dealt with gang stuff.

527
00:43:21,307 --> 00:43:26,270
<i>They said he's basically</i>
<i>their version of Internal Affairs.</i>

528
00:43:29,982 --> 00:43:31,150
Yeong-geun.

529
00:43:31,859 --> 00:43:32,860
Yeong-geun!

530
00:43:32,943 --> 00:43:35,154
How could you do this to me?

531
00:43:48,584 --> 00:43:52,796
<i>He tosses money into the grave</i>
<i>when he buries troublemakers in the gang.</i>

532
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:55,299
<i>That's another reason</i>
<i>they call him "Noja."</i>

533
00:43:56,133 --> 00:43:58,761
You know, as in the money
they send the dead off with.

534
00:43:59,762 --> 00:44:03,057
Everyone scattered
after the gang fell apart,

535
00:44:03,599 --> 00:44:05,100
but he's still scary.

536
00:44:05,601 --> 00:44:07,394
Be careful when you go after him.

537
00:44:10,606 --> 00:44:13,233
What a load of shit. He's just a thug.

538
00:44:38,133 --> 00:44:39,259
ACCOUNTANT SON SOO-HYUN

539
00:44:48,936 --> 00:44:51,563
Sir! You can't park here!

540
00:44:52,439 --> 00:44:53,399
You need to move…

541
00:44:58,320 --> 00:45:00,030
Isn't that a baseball bat?

542
00:45:27,725 --> 00:45:28,559
<i>Noja?</i>

543
00:45:28,642 --> 00:45:30,519
You fucking bastard.

544
00:46:50,766 --> 00:46:52,059
Damn it.

545
00:48:13,765 --> 00:48:15,976
You probably need some time to settle in.

546
00:48:16,894 --> 00:48:19,855
The doctor said take one
if you feel suffocated or anxious.

547
00:48:22,357 --> 00:48:24,693
You've gotta toughen up mentally.

548
00:48:25,277 --> 00:48:27,362
You'll have to hide here for a while.

549
00:48:27,446 --> 00:48:28,655
Will we…

550
00:48:31,033 --> 00:48:31,867
be okay?

551
00:48:33,452 --> 00:48:35,495
We'll be fine. Just trust me.

552
00:49:47,109 --> 00:49:48,568
Who am I?

553
00:49:52,489 --> 00:49:53,323
You wanna know?

554
00:54:30,392 --> 00:54:33,311
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
